{"name": "The Fool Protocol", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"300\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/c4ce842c0920b0f0d4103d32ecf72549.poster.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/c4ce842c0920b0f0d4103d32ecf72549.webm?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Ah\u2026 so this \u2018presence\u2019 intends to guide <strong>C.r0</strong> through this little tragedy? Fascinating.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"450\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/44b38ff6b14373d4f23eefa8fd7cc4d8.poster.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"800\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/44b38ff6b14373d4f23eefa8fd7cc4d8.webm?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/44b38ff6b14373d4f23eefa8fd7cc4d8.mp4?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Look at him... still searching for purpose beneath a dying moon. They always do.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guide <strong>C.r0</strong> through forgotten basilicas, decaying laboratories and dying cities where cybernetic demons, corrupted AI and devoted cults lurk beneath the mysteries of the tarot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras_big/0a8dbad4bbcf5f0daf7ac40a8c02a45f.avif?t=1782178111\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0a8dbad4bbcf5f0daf7ac40a8c02a45f.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>HUNT THE DEMONS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The demons are hungry. The machines are angry. The cultists are insane. You'll get along wonderfully.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.poster.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.webm?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/0e5ee9ff597d76e3c9e0c309185960da.mp4?t=1782178111\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle relentless enemies across a dying techno-gothic world where every encounter demands precision, timing and determination.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>CHALLENGE THE ARCANA</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Ah yes... the stars of this little tragedy. Such fascinating creatures. Some seek power. Some seek purpose. Some simply wish to watch everything burn. Hahaha...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras_big/033b4972fd821f8b14a236dfb7bce9a6.avif?t=1782178111\" height=\"732\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/033b4972fd821f8b14a236dfb7bce9a6.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Face eight powerful bosses inspired by the Major Arcana, each with their own twisted ideals, abilities and stories. Learn their patterns, overcome their deadliest attacks and uncover the secrets hidden behind the cards that shape this world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>FIND UNLIKELY ALLIES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Ah... companionship. One of humanity's favorite delusions.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" data-big-src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras_big/9ccf80461d0eb5b8c3e2e6d6a7617300.avif?t=1782178111\" height=\"878\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/extras/9ccf80461d0eb5b8c3e2e6d6a7617300.avif?t=1782178111\" width=\"1560\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout his journey, C.r0 will encounter hunters, machines, wanderers and lost souls, each carrying their own burdens, ambitions and secrets. Some may become trusted allies. Others may become something far more dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Let's see if your story ends any differently.</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Join C.r0 on an action-platforming adventure to hunt cybernetic demons and corrupted AI across a gothic world inspired by the mysteries of the tarot. Battle twisted cults, deadly hunters and powerful machines while uncovering the secrets hidden within The Fool Protocol.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4771140/4b7eec89a23cec779ed7134bb1ea1fe6954c2568/header.jpg?t=1782178111", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Action", "Adventure", "Action-Adventure", "2D Platformer", "Precision Platformer", "Side Scroller"], "developers": "The F00L", "publishers": "The F00L", "release_date": "To be announced", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4771140", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "16 July 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/fhAasBMlYAM", "first_seen": 1784160000.0, "review_rank": 270}